      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The measure will take the value true if all the requirements in the referred data product specification are fulfilled." ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://standards.isotc211.org/19157/-3/1/dqc/content/qualityMeasure> ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "MD101" .
