      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "10% (Domain of a ‘buildingType’ attribute is defined as the following set of values {1,2,0}; 10 out of 100 ‘building’ objects contain value ‘X’ in ‘buildingType’ attribute)." ;
