      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MD25e_1" ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """48 (count double line drain and slivers that do not fulfil the threshold values set by thinness ratio and maximum sliver area).
Key: 1) Single line drain
2) Double line drain
a) Maximum area parameter prevents correct double line drain portrayal from being flagged as an error""" ;
