      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A criterion for the establishing of correspondence should also be stated (e.g. allowing for correspondence to the closest position, correspondence on vertices or along lines). The criteria for finding the corresponding points shall be reported with the data quality evaluation result." ;
