      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MD30" ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """The calculation of ei is given by MD28_1, MD28_2 and MD28_3 in one, two and three dimensions.
A criterion for the establishing of correspondence should also be stated (e.g. allowing for correspondence to the closest position, correspondence on vertices or along lines). The criterion/criteria for finding the corresponding points shall be reported with the data quality evaluation result.""" ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://standards.isotc211.org/19157/-3/1/dqc/content/qualityMeasure> ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "MD30" ;
