      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MD32" ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The covariance matrix generalizes the concept of variance from one to n dimensions, i.e. from scalar-valued random variables to vector-valued random variables (tuples of scalar random variables)." ;
