      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MD48" ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Absolute horizontal accuracy of the data coordinates, expressed in terms of circular error at 90 % probability given that a bias is present. A manner of calculating the comparison of the data (source) and the control (reference)." ;
